   "en": "⟦0⟧ is a ⟦1⟧ ⟦2⟧ in Southeast Asia with a population of ⟦3⟧. It borders ⟦4⟧ and ⟦5⟧ Indochina to the east, ⟦6⟧ to the north, ⟦7⟧ to the northeast, the ⟦8⟧ to the west, and has sea access to the south. Burma is mainly plains, forests and hills.",
